# OB-00 + OB-10 10.11.2026): AiPlayerbot.QuestFirstProgression.StartZoneMinLevel.ObjectiveWindow (0 off default / 1 all / 2 cohort B /
# 3 cohort A) and .ObjectiveWindow.AboveLevels (default 2, 1..3). For a bot StartZoneMinLevel holds, the objective check of a quest in
# its log that is not complete accepts up to L + AboveLevels instead of L + 1. Pins the keys (dist 0 / 2, clamped reads, echo), the pure
# rules, the snapshot bit (switch first, bot thread), the one helper at both objective-level sites (the book's AboveWindow reason only;
# every other bot keeps the old +1 line), the unchanged giver / accept / capability rules, the lines and the minute report. Negative
# probes at the end.

